 "remarks": "Welcome to 50 Wilton Crest, a sunlit, move-in-ready townhome nestled in the heart of South Wilton. Offering 1,449 square feet of thoughtfully designed living space, this 2-bedroom, 2.5-bath residence blends effortless main-level living with soaring architectural volume. Step inside to discover vaulted ceilings, skylights, and fresh paint throughout. The main level features a seamless, light-filled layout complete with refinished hardwood floors in the living and dining areas, a cozy wood-burning fireplace, and sliders opening to two private decks. The updated kitchen shines with granite countertops and stainless steel appliances, solid wood cabinets with dovetailed soft close drawers. Enjoy true one-level convenience with the primary suite-boasting brand-new hardwood floors and an en-suite bath-alongside main-floor laundry and a powder room. Upstairs, a private second bedroom and full bath offer an ideal retreat for guests or a home office, while a full, unfinished lower level provides abundant storage or future expansion potential. Additional highlights include central air conditioning, a 2023 hot water heater, and a detached 1-car garage just steps from your front walkway. Residents of Wilton Crest enjoy community amenities, including a swimming pool, tennis courts, and nicely maintained grounds-all moments from Wilton Center, Route 7, Metro-North trains, shopping, and dining. Quick close possible!",
